  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You weave together magic and technology when infiltrating your foes</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Mana sphere, Technomancy sphere</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Whenever you create or move a sprite into a creature, you may create a manabond with them as if you had affected them with an expunge or (manipulation). A sprite may create or concentrate on a manabond between you and a creature that contains it in place of executing a program.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/arcforge-feats#toc31\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
